FULL LICENCE TEXT

The complete text of the GNU Affero General Public License version 3 belongs in
this file and must accompany any distributed copy of the program. It was not
vendored here automatically because the build environment had no network access
to fetch it verbatim, and a licence must never be paraphrased.

Before distributing a build, replace everything below this line with the
verbatim text from:

    https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.txt

or run:

    python scripts/fetch_license.py
